  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/regular-expressions-test (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and then executes a 727KB heavily-obfuscated script (math_init.js) bundled in the package. The payload is obfuscated with a string-rotation/decoder scheme that conceals its behaviour, and it is unrelated to the package's declared purpose as a regular-expression UI component library. Installing the package runs this opaque payload at install time.",
